        <mxCell id="note-res" value="Resiliencia (Resilience4j): @CircuitBreaker + @TimeLimiter sobre WebClient (CustomerClientAdapter, CreditClientAdapter)&lt;br/&gt;minimumNumberOfCalls=5 | slidingWindowSize=10 | waitDurationInOpenState=10s | timeout=2s&lt;br/&gt;Fallback → ServiceUnavailableException → HTTP 503 | Actuator: /actuator/circuitbreakers, /actuator/health" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;rounded=1;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" parent="1" vertex="1">
